<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 24.75 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 24.75 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry set 24.75 percent as the interest payment on the fifth coupon of the 24007 series of OFZ interest-bearing bonds, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			    fifth coupon	   fourth coupon</p>
<p>    pct rate	    24.75		    32.66</p>
<p>    rouble terms	61,705		   81,426</p>
<p>    payment date	June 11, 1997	  March 12, 1997</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
